*** B5: module summation `A + B` — the importer sees both modules' signatures.
fmod A is
  sort SA . ops a1 a2 : -> SA [ctor] . op fa : SA -> SA . eq fa(a1) = a2 .
endfm
fmod B is
  sort SB . ops b1 b2 : -> SB [ctor] . op fb : SB -> SB . eq fb(b1) = b2 .
endfm
fmod AB is
  protecting A + B .
endfm
red fa(a1) .   *** a2
red fb(b1) .   *** b2
